<p>
    <strong>Core Gameplan:</strong> Stasis wants to lock you out of your
    untap step entirely, then chip you down with <a
        href="#"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Black Vise">Black Vise</a
    > while keeping Stasis online through <a
        href="#"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Forsaken City">Forsaken City</a
    > or <a
        href="#"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Quirion Ranger">Quirion Ranger</a
    >. Your way out is instant-speed enchantment removal—<a
        href="#"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Seal of Cleansing">Seal of Cleansing</a
    > and <a
        href="#"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Disenchant">Disenchant</a
    >. Break the lock on their end step, then untap and go off.
</p>
<p>
    <strong>Sideboard Strategy:</strong> Rebuild the deck for this one. Cut the
    removal that does nothing here (<a
        href="#"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Swords to Plowshares"
        >Swords to Plowshares</a
    >, <a
        href="#"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Tsabo's Web">Tsabo's Web</a
    >), your expensive card draw (<a
        href="#"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Intuition">Intuition</a
    >, <a
        href="#"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Frantic Search">Frantic Search</a
    >), and trim <a
        href="#"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Parallax Wave">Parallax Wave</a
    >. Bring in the full control package: <a
        href="#"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Defense Grid">Defense Grid</a
    >, <a
        href="#"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Exalted Angel">Exalted Angel</a
    >, <a href="#" class="card-hover" data-card-name="Abeyance"
        >Abeyance</a
    >, <a
        href="#"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Arcane Denial">Arcane Denial</a
    >, and <a
        href="#"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Seal of Cleansing">Seal of Cleansing</a
    >.
</p>
